{
  "bodyHash": "1bdab81c845369bd",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>Urkaz Moon Tools</h1>\n<p>\n    此模組新增了一個物品與一個方塊，協助您查看並偵測目前的月相。\n</p>\n<h2>新增物品與方塊</h2>\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"20%\" align=\"center\">\n            <h3>月相時鐘</h3><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/inv_clock.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"50%\">\n            此時鐘會顯示目前的月相。手持該時鐘並右鍵點擊，會在聊天欄中顯示月相名稱。\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/recipe_clock.png\"><br><i>月相時鐘合成配方</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"20%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            <h3>月相偵測器</h3><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/inv_sensor.png\">\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"2\">\n            此方塊會根據目前月相發出紅石訊號。月相偵測器僅在夜間運作，但您可以在模組設定中將其改為全天候運作。</br>\n            各月相對應的紅石強度也可在模組設定中進行調整。\n        </td>\n        <td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/recipe_sensor.png\"><br><i>月相偵測器合成配方</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/help_redstone.png\" width=\"257\" height=\"135\"><br><i>紅石訊號</i>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>模組相容性</h2>\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enhanced-celestials\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/enhanced-celestials.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Enhanced Celestials\n        </a></td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            月相時鐘上的月亮圖示將與月亮本身著上相同顏色。<br><br>在模組設定中，可設定月相偵測器在任何事件發生時額外輸出紅石訊號。\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lunar\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/lunar.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Lunar\n        </a></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/crimson-moon-revived\" target=\"_blank\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/crimson_moon.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </br>Crimson Moon\n        </a></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/bloodmoon.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></td>\n        <td width=\"50%\" rowspan=\"2\">在血月事件期間，月相時鐘的月亮圖示會變為紅色；在豐收月事件期間則會變為藍色。\n            <ul>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\"> 若兩個事件同時發生，時鐘將同時顯示兩者（當同時啟用這兩個模組時可能會出現此情況）。\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            在模組設定中，可設定月相偵測器在豐收月與血月事件期間額外輸出紅石訊號：\n            <ul>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"> 血月：9\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_100.png\"> 豐收月：10\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\">\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/nyx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>依賴項目</h2>\n\n\"Urkaz Moon Tools\" 需要以下模組才能運作：\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">1.18.3 - 1.21.1<br>必要</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Cloth Config API<br>\n                <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cloth-config\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/cloth-config.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2>相容性對照表</h2>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>❗ = 必要</li>\n  <!--li>❔ = Optional</li-->\n  <li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"> = 模組相容</li>\n  <li><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_110.png\"> = 舊版相容</li>\n</ul>  \n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n    <tr>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.21.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.6</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.4</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.20.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.4</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.3</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19.1</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.19</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.18.2</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.16.5</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">1.12.2</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/cloth-config.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Cloth Config API\n        </td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\">❗</td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/master/resources/thirdparty/enhanced-celestials.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> Enhanced Celestials\n        </td>\n<td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Urkaz/UrkazMoonTools/1.12.2/src/main/resources/assets/urkazmoontools/textures/item/moonclock_10.png\"></td>\n        <td align=